    "title": "Chelan Lady Goats Sweep Omak, Clinch Ninth Straight League Title - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago The Chelan Lady Goats traveled to Omak on Tuesday night and earned a 3-0 sweep over the Omak Pioneers, winning 25-23, 25-16, 25-21. The victory also secured the Goats’ ninth consecutive Caribou Trail League title, continuing an impressive run of dominance in league play. Omak kept things competitive in the first and third sets with long rallies and tough serving, but the Goats found a way to close out the match despite a slow start and some offensive inconsistencies. Read full article\n1",
